      "writtenOn": "2018-09-10T06:25:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I did check the OpenCL datatype for vector type naming: https://www.khronos.org/registry/OpenCL/sdk/1.2/docs/man/xhtml/dataTypes.html\nThe naming rule OpenCL using is like $type + n, but considering we have types like uint8, I add a character \u0027v\u0027 between the types and nums.\n\nFor matrix type naming, I just tried to have minimum modification from the original naming rule.",
